{"title":"两数求和（本地验证样例）","tags":["数学"],"difficulty":"EASY","contentMarkdown":"给定两个整数 a 和 b，计算它们的和。ACM 模式从标准输入读取两个以空格分隔的整数，输出一个整数作为总和；核心代码模式实现 Solution.solve(a, b)，返回同一个结果。两个整数均在 32 位有符号整数范围内，输入保证最终结果在 64 位有符号整数范围内。示例：输入 2 3 时，输出 5。请注意负数、零和整数边界情况，程序只需处理一组输入。","judgeCases":[{"input":"0 1","output":"1","isHidden":false},{"input":"1 2","output":"3","isHidden":false},{"input":"2 3","output":"5","isHidden":true},{"input":"3 4","output":"7","isHidden":true},{"input":"4 5","output":"9","isHidden":true},{"input":"5 6","output":"11","isHidden":true},{"input":"6 7","output":"13","isHidden":true},{"input":"7 8","output":"15","isHidden":true},{"input":"8 9","output":"17","isHidden":true},{"input":"9 10","output":"19","isHidden":true},{"input":"10 11","output":"21","isHidden":true},{"input":"11 12","output":"23","isHidden":true},{"input":"12 13","output":"25","isHidden":true},{"input":"13 14","output":"27","isHidden":true},{"input":"14 15","output":"29","isHidden":true},{"input":"15 16","output":"31","isHidden":true},{"input":"16 17","output":"33","isHidden":true},{"input":"17 18","output":"35","isHidden":true},{"input":"18 19","output":"37","isHidden":true},{"input":"19 20","output":"39","isHidden":true}],"judgeConfig":{"timeLimit":2000,"memoryLimit":262144,"outputLimitBytes":1048576},"problemSpec":{"mode":"function","className":"Solution","methodName":"solve","parameters":[{"name":"a","type":"long"},{"name":"b","type":"long"}],"returnType":"long","resultSource":"return","comparator":{"type":"EXACT","epsilon":null},"harnessVersion":1,"judgeCases":[{"input":"{\"a\": 0, \"b\": 1}","output":"1","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\"a\": 1, \"b\": 2}","output":"3","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\"a\": 2, \"b\": 3}","output":"5","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\"a\": 3, \"b\": 4}","output":"7","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\"a\": 4, \"b\": 5}","output":"9","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\"a\": 5, \"b\": 6}","output":"11","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\"a\": 6, \"b\": 7}","output":"13","isHidden":true},{"